{"id":"1e536fad96aebabd","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-clique.md","title":"CLIQUE","display":"df-clique — CLIQUE","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-finite-graph]]"],"display":"df-clique — CLIQUE","label":"28-df-clique","aliases":["28-df-clique"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clique — CLIQUE"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-clique"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-clique</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\">\\(G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\)</span> (有限简单无向图, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V\">\\(S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (顶点子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S)\\)</span> (团谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}:\\{(G,k)\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\;k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}:\\{(G,k)\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\;k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> （<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>，本条按下式取其别名）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (CLIQUE 语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq V\\land\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\neq v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\in E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq V\\land\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\neq v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\in E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\land\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;(|S|\\geq k\\land\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\land\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;(|S|\\geq k\\land\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源核对：习题2.15；印刷65页；PDF91页。至少阈值的团定义已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-finite-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}$ (有限简单无向图, see [[28-df-finite-graph]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}:\\{(G,k)\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\;k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ （$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}$ 见 [[28-df-finite-graph]]，本条按下式取其别名）","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}:\\{(G,k)\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{UGraph},\\;k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{GN}}(G,k)\\qquad((G,k)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\times\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S)\\leftrightarrow S\\subseteq V\\land\\forall u,v\\in S\\;(u\\neq v\\to\\{u,v\\}\\in E)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLIQUE}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CLIQUE}}(G,k)\\mid G=(V,E)\\in\\mathrm{UGraph}\\land k\\in\\mathbb{N}\\land\\exists S\\subseteq V\\;(|S|\\geq k\\land\\mathrm{IsClique}_G(S))\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1231,"backlinks